31. Conclusion

The B2B Order Management Platform is intended to demonstrate the complete lifecycle of a professional full-stack development project, from requirements analysis and system design to implementation, testing, validation, documentation, and final presentation.

The project will provide a realistic business workflow while demonstrating practical skills in React, Node.js, Express.js, PostgreSQL, REST APIs, JWT authentication, role-based authorization, database management, testing, and professional software documentation.

The final system will be designed as a reproducible, testable, documented, and portfolio-oriented project suitable for mentor review and technical demonstration.




